  "referenceNumber": "RUS3729",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect that Alan Eduardovich GAGLOEV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following ground: Alan Eduardovich GAGLOEV is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by working as an adviser to the President of the Russian Federation.\n",
